sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title JRN-003 SAR Filing — Consent Hold Path (NCA Moratorium & Consent Grant)

    participant EB as SVC-102 Event Bus
    participant KYC as SVC-014 KYC/AML
    participant CC as SVC-015 Compliance Core
    participant MLRO as PER-052 MLRO
    participant RB as SVC-001 Retail Banking
    participant AL as SVC-103 Audit & Logging
    participant NCA as NCA SAR Online

    Note over MLRO,NCA: PRE-CONDITION: Investigation complete, SAR prepared (happy path steps 1-19 complete)

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over MLRO,KYC: SAR-PH-004 — Consent SAR Flagged
        MLRO->>CC: Select 'consent SAR' — enter consent_transaction_ref
        CC->>KYC: PATCH /sars/{id} — consent_requested=true, consent_transaction_ref
        Note right of KYC: consent_status = awaiting_nca_response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over MLRO,NCA: SAR-PH-005 — Consent SAR Submission
        CC->>KYC: POST /sars/{id}/submit
        KYC->>NCA: POST SAR payload (consent SAR flagged)
        NCA-->>KYC: 200 OK + nca_reference
        Note right of KYC: moratorium_expiry = filing_date + 7 days<br/>consent_status = awaiting_nca_response<br/>status = filed
        KYC->>EB: Publish SARFiled (EVT-016)
        KYC->>EB: Publish SARConsentRequested (EVT-017)
        Note right of EB: Payload: {sar_id, customer_id,<br/>consent_transaction_ref,<br/>moratorium_expiry_date}
        EB->>RB: SARConsentRequested consumed
        Note right of RB: FAIL-CLOSED: transaction {consent_transaction_ref}<br/>placed on hold<br/>Will NOT be released without EVT-018
        EB->>AL: SARConsentRequested → WORM audit log
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over MLRO,NCA: SAR-PH-006 — NCA Moratorium Active (Days 1-7)
        NCA-->>MLRO: Moratorium notice issued (out-of-band: SAR Online portal)
        MLRO->>CC: Record moratorium notice received
        CC->>KYC: POST /sars/{id}/consent-response<br/>{consent_outcome: moratorium_active, moratorium_expiry_date}
        Note right of KYC: consent_status = moratorium_active
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over MLRO,NCA: SAR-PH-006 — NCA Grants Consent (Within Moratorium)
        NCA-->>MLRO: Consent granted (out-of-band: SAR Online)
        MLRO->>CC: Record NCA consent granted
        CC->>KYC: POST /sars/{id}/consent-response<br/>{consent_outcome: granted, nca_response_date, nca_response_reference}
        Note right of KYC: consent_status = granted
        KYC->>EB: Publish SARConsentGranted (EVT-018)
        Note right of EB: Payload: {sar_id, customer_id,<br/>consent_transaction_ref,<br/>consent_outcome: granted, granted_at}
        EB->>RB: SARConsentGranted consumed — transaction hold released
        Note right of RB: Transaction {consent_transaction_ref} may now be processed<br/>Hold released ONLY on EVT-018 receipt
        EB->>AL: SARConsentGranted → WORM audit log
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over RB,AL: ALTERNATIVE: NCA Refuses Consent
        Note over RB,AL: consent_outcome=refused → NO EVT-018 published<br/>Transaction hold REMAINS INDEFINITELY<br/>MLRO decides: close account or escalate to NCA<br/>No customer disclosure of SAR reason (POCA s333A)
    end

    Note over MLRO,NCA: REGULATORY CONTROLS SUMMARY:<br/>1. Transaction hold is FAIL-CLOSED — persists without positive EVT-018<br/>2. Customer receives no SAR information at any stage<br/>3. Account hold notice uses generic approved language only<br/>4. All consent events immutably logged in WORM pipeline
